    "title": "CSS 布局与盒模型",
    "description": "Flexbox、Grid、定位、层叠上下文等 CSS 布局核心知识",
    "questions": [
      {
        "id": "css-1",
        "type": "single",
        "content": "以下哪个属性可以开启 Flex 布局？",
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "a",
            "text": "display: block"
          },
          {
            "id": "b",
            "text": "display: flex"
          },
          {
            "id": "c",
            "text": "position: flex"
          },
          {
            "id": "d",
            "text": "float: flex"
          }
        ],
        "correctAnswers": ["b"],
        "explanation": "display: flex 将元素设为弹性容器，其子元素成为弹性项目。",
        "difficulty": "easy",
        "tags": ["Flexbox", "布局"]
      },
      {
        "id": "css-2",
        "type": "multiple",
        "content": "哪些 CSS 属性可以创建新的层叠上下文？",
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "a",
            "text": "opacity 小于 1"
          },
          {
            "id": "b",
            "text": "transform 非 none"
          },
          {
            "id": "c",
            "text": "position: relative 配合 z-index"
          },
          {
            "id": "d",
            "text": "display: grid"
          }
        ],
        "correctAnswers": ["a", "b", "c"],
        "explanation": "opacity < 1、transform 非 none、position 配合 z-index 都可以创建层叠上下文。display: grid 本身不会。",
        "difficulty": "medium",
        "tags": ["层叠上下文", "z-index"]
      },
      {
        "id": "css-3",
        "type": "true_false",
        "content": "`margin-top` 和 `margin-bottom` 在相邻块级元素之间会发生外边距折叠。",
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "a",
            "text": "正确"
          },
          {
            "id": "b",
            "text": "错误"
          }
        ],
        "correctAnswers": ["a"],
        "explanation": "垂直相邻的两个块级元素的外边距会合并（折叠）为一个外边距，取较大值。",
        "difficulty": "medium",
        "tags": ["盒模型", "外边距折叠"]
      },
